  "content": "<p>一个用Scala编写的模组库。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>此模组包含Scala标准库，该库在1.13.2版本中被移除。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>提供语言加载器 \"kotori_scala\"。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li>Scala（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.scala-lang.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.scala-lang.org/</a>）根据<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.apache.org%252flicenses%252fLICENSE-2.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apache许可证2.0版</a>授权。（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.scala-lang.org%252flicense%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.scala-lang.org/license/</a>）</li>\n<li>Cats（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftypelevel.org%252fcats%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://typelevel.org/cats/</a>）根据MIT许可证授权（<a href=\"https://github.com/typelevel/cats/blob/master/COPYING\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/typelevel/cats/blob/master/COPYING</a>）。</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">联系方式：</span></p><ul>\n<li>Discord: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ThxxGXMjZn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/ThxxGXMjZn</a></li>\n<li>GitHub: 见下方</li>\n<li>Twitter: <a href=\"https://twitter.com/small_bird_316\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://twitter.com/small_bird_316</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>带有“-fabric”后缀的文件适用于Fabric。</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>没有后缀的版本适用于<strong>Minecraft Forge</strong>。</strong></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>源代码</p><ul>\n<li>Forge -&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Kotori316/SLP\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Kotori316/SLP</a></li>\n<li>Fabric -&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Kotori316/SLP-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Kotori316/SLP-fabric</a></li>\n</ul>",
